{"server":"cn","storyId":"main_9_level_st_09-03","groupId":"main_9","stageId":"st_09-03","title":"临近的暴风","storyCode":"9-20","avgTag":"幕间","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_st_09-03.txt","sourceHash":"906864d8527837f484bdebf3a7c209965d2e97ee83435196420966181bc44a22","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_corridor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Misery","speakerId":"avg_npc_235","isRemote":false,"text":"......都给我吧。为了把她送回来，你赶了一路，很辛苦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Misery","speakerId":"avg_npc_235","isRemote":false,"text":"下面的事，我亲自处理。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"遗物和骨灰匣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"切尔诺伯格事件结束后，类似的紧急通讯声已经有整整十一个月又二十七天没有在罗德岛的甲板上响起了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"——这一次牺牲的是谁？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Misery","speakerId":"avg_npc_235","isRemote":false,"text":"Outcast。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"我看到了，你手中握着的是她的弹巢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"虽然不想承认，但在来的路上，我已经想过这个答案。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"我曾经和她打过一个赌——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"现在看来，她还是赢了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Misery","speakerId":"avg_npc_235","isRemote":false,"text":"凯尔希，下面的会议，我会缺席。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Misery","speakerId":"avg_npc_235","isRemote":false,"text":"按照惯例，精英干员的葬礼将由你亲自主持......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Misery","speakerId":"avg_npc_235","isRemote":false,"text":"但这次，我希望由我来告别她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"......我想没有人会有异议，包括她自己。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Misery","speakerId":"avg_npc_235","isRemote":false,"text":"既然会议中止，那么，我会在这里给出我最终的选择——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"Misery，我知道你的答案。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Misery","speakerId":"avg_npc_235","isRemote":false,"text":"那你肯定也知道其他人的答案。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Misery","speakerId":"avg_npc_235","isRemote":false,"text":"情况发生了变化。没人喜欢这个变化，但大家都清楚只能这么选。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Misery","speakerId":"avg_npc_235","isRemote":false,"text":"——我们必须尽快进入伦蒂尼姆。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"你们都很清楚，我的立场始终如一——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"但无论你们最终是否决定支持我的提议，我都必须强调，罗德岛并不会为了宣泄任何私人情感而决定未来的航向。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Misery","speakerId":"avg_npc_235","isRemote":false,"text":"你是在提醒我，不要想着为Outcast报仇？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Misery","speakerId":"avg_npc_235","isRemote":false,"text":"你放心。我的内心是充满了悲痛和愤怒，可我还记得自己的职责。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Misery","speakerId":"avg_npc_235","isRemote":false,"text":"只是，我要亲眼看一看能杀死Outcast的究竟是什么——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Misery","speakerId":"avg_npc_235","isRemote":false,"text":"那不会是一个人，或者几个人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Misery","speakerId":"avg_npc_235","isRemote":false,"text":"凯尔希......假如我们不去寻找真相，那么笼罩着伦蒂尼姆乃至整个维多利亚的阴云只会更加肆无忌惮。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Misery","speakerId":"avg_npc_235","isRemote":false,"text":"到时候，不止Outcast......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Misery","speakerId":"avg_npc_235","isRemote":false,"text":"我会死，我们都会。没有人能逃脱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Misery","speakerId":"avg_npc_235","isRemote":false,"text":"就像你说的，罗德岛不会为了死者复仇......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Misery","speakerId":"avg_npc_235","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，我们都想为生者创造继续活下去的机会。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_canteen"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"简妮","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......这是什么地方？我是不是又走错路了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"简妮","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"糟糕，快到约好的时间了，我得快点走......唉，奥利弗叔叔怎么没说过，这艘船有这么大呀！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苇草","speakerId":"avg_226_weed_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"简妮","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咦，你是......？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"简妮","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，请、请等一下！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苇草","speakerId":"avg_226_weed_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"简妮","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"简妮","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（为什么她看起来就像完全不认识我？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"简妮","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（不，我不可能认错人。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"简妮","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（上船之后，好几次想找人问问她怎么样了，但他们都要么不知道，要么不告诉我。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"简妮","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（唔......为了她的安全，也许这是更妥当的做法？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"简妮","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"简妮","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你......你是在这里看书吗？这本《骑士艾凡赫传奇》......我也看过，而且很喜欢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"简妮","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"书里描写的那段维多利亚历史很有趣，不是吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苇草","speakerId":"avg_226_weed_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有趣......么？还好......但不是真的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苇草","speakerId":"avg_226_weed_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小说......就只是小说而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"简妮","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......这么说也没错。你还想看其他小说吗？我有好多......呃，对不起，我忘了自己都没带出来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苇草","speakerId":"avg_226_weed_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你喜欢这本......可以送给你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"简妮","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，这样好吗？谢、谢谢......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苇草","speakerId":"avg_226_weed_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我走了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"简妮","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊好的，再见！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"简妮","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（......还能再见吗？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"简妮","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（她手里的另一本书是......诗集？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"简妮","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"西莫·威廉姆斯......作者姓名和封面都好眼熟。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_corridor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"简妮","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"约好的地方......就是这里了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"简妮","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"识、识别码？那是什么东西？《新干员指引》里有写吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"简妮","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，马上就要迟到了，还是先敲下门试试吧！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"请进来吧！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"21_I14"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"下午好，薇洛小姐......还是应该叫你干员琴柳？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"琴柳","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊......阿米娅小姐！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"请和大家一样叫我阿米娅吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"琴柳","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"真是不好意思......阿米娅这么忙，还要抽时间来见我。前两天体检的时候，亚叶小姐说你一天只休息五个小时......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"亚叶姐姐总是很担心我的身体。不过没关系，我最近的健康状况很不错，而且我也一直很想再见见你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"琴柳","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......这里就是Outcast以前的办公室？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。其实她并没有在这里待很久，出事前两个月，我们刚刚说服她接受了岗位调动。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"琴柳","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"她和我说过，在来小丘郡之前，她已经差不多半退休了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"但她依然坚持申请去执行这次任务。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"琴柳","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我时常回想她在那几天说的每一句话......我相信她早就做好了面对一切的准备。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"Outcast确实是这样的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"即便是在精英干员中，Outcast的性格都称得上特别——她总能轻松地做出一些普通人眼里很艰难的决定。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"琴柳","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，她说......她曾经因为一次战争中的失败调停，放弃了教会里很高的职位。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"唔......离开拉特兰教会的部分确有其事，但是失败的调停？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我不记得Outcast的档案里有这项记载，反而，这听起来很像Misery的一件往事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"琴柳","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"琴柳","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哈......哈哈......不知道为什么，这很像她会做的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"可能有些人会因此觉得Outcast不够真诚......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"琴柳","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不，即便你告诉我，她说的并不全是实话，她仍是我见过最真诚的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你真的这么想？嗯......我并不是很意外，毕竟Outcast看人的眼光从不出错。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"琴柳","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"阿米娅，我理解你的时间很宝贵......但你愿不愿意再多跟我说一些她的故事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"当然。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"只是，这故事会很长——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"琴柳","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"只要你有空，我随时想听。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"好啊，我相信......去伦蒂尼姆的路上，我们会有很多时间的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"数月后"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_safehouseindoor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"到底修好了没啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别着急嘛，这镇子太荒了，要找到个能给发报机用的替换线圈很不容易......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"还是我来吧。你这轻轻一碰设备就冒烟的问题，看来根本没好转。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"本来这安全屋也很久没人用了嘛......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"说到底，我就不该听你的走这条路线。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"这几个月兜兜转转，一半时间都在没人烟的地方吃沙！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"几年没见，陈陈你怎么瞪起人来更凶了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"......别嘟囔了，根本不够小声，我都听得见。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"你问我为什么着急？我还纳闷你怎么不急！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"这一趟出来多久了，别说鬼魂部队，我们连个像样的线索都没找到！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"换作我还在龙门当警察的时候，遇到这种情况，我都想叫你赶紧死心......没什么人质能撑这么久。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......不。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道队长一定还活着。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"同样的，她知道我会想办法救她，她也会想尽办法来和我会合。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"唉。算了算了，我真是拿你没办法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"要是能说服你，我至于被你拽着到处跑这么久？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那当然是因为......陈陈你一直都对我这么好！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"行了，你的执着，我不是不明白。那些年，我满心想着找那个人的时候，你也始终支持着我......算了，眼下不提这个。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"——总之，你也都听到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"小丘郡事件对外宣称早有定论，就是一场军队演习事故。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"所有受伤和生病的平民都得到了赔偿和安置——至少政府文件里就是这么写的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"深池，或者说鬼魂部队，无论在你离开时候他们是不是占领了小丘郡，现在看起来都已经悄无声息地撤离了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"这一点，就算我们回去亲眼确认，也不会改变。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我同意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我还记得我看见的全部。我相信，再怎么貌似平静，小丘郡内部......以及周围很多城市里，都还是发生了很大的变化。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且......一想到这些变化在众目睽睽之下被藏得这么好，陈陈你不觉得更恐怖了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果敌人在闹出了这么大动静之后选择了再次蛰伏，那只能说明，他们背后还有更大的图谋！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在维多利亚......随时都会有比小丘郡更大的危机被引爆。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"我信你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"......所以我在这里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"但我没有把握还有多少人会信你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这就是为什么我们要继续努力！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"这么看，我们还是得想办法进入大城市。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"你还记得休斯吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那个......胖胖的训练时候总是摔得满头包的男同学？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"......人家已经是千贸城商业联盟的副主席。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"他的话，是我们这帮同学里，最有可能获知一些被刻意藏起来的信息的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其实，在陈陈你说之前，我早就想过去找休斯......不，不光休斯，我还想试试看找大个子格林，红头发比尔......找大家帮忙！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这些事，我一个人也试过，可是很难办到......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是现在，我身边有你，还有一路上罗德岛的大家慷慨提供的物资和信息支持——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我感觉充满了希望！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"我还是得先提醒你，我没把握他们能否被说服——啊？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"你*维多利亚问候语*干什么啊突然这么大力拉我！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"陈陈，发报机亮了哎！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"......是罗德岛的紧急电讯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"发报机坏了之前，他们才刚收到我们发出去的定位消息吧？难道说罗德岛一直在找我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"........."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么啦？你的脸色就像刚才收到的信息给你来了一整套拳......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，我好像看懂了......又是关于她的消息？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"......你猜得没错。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"接下来的事，我需要好好想一想。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_aircraft_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"avg_npc_156_1","isRemote":true,"text":"杰西卡，任务进行得怎么样？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_npc_237","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，我在路上了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"avg_npc_156_1","isRemote":true,"text":"不能放松警惕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_npc_237","isRemote":false,"text":"放心吧，雷蛇前辈......虽然我没怎么回过维多利亚，但是我们的飞行器已经获得了出入许可，导航系统也在正常运作中。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"avg_npc_156_1","isRemote":true,"text":"这次护送侨民回哥伦比亚的任务说难不难，但随时可能生变。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_npc_237","isRemote":false,"text":"侨民给我们发信的时候，我还是有点惊讶的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_npc_237","isRemote":false,"text":"这一路上都还算风平浪静，情况真、真的已经那么严重了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_npc_237","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......抱歉，在队长和队员们面前不太好表现出来，可我确实还是有点紧张。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"avg_npc_156_1","isRemote":true,"text":"......你的队长不在？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_npc_237","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，是的，在到维多利亚之后不久，她就带着一部分人走了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_npc_237","isRemote":false,"text":"有可能......是有别的任务？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"avg_npc_156_1","isRemote":true,"text":"......撤侨行动被委托给了你们装备与应用技术部门，这显然是有原因的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_npc_237","isRemote":false,"text":"显、显然吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"avg_npc_156_1","isRemote":true,"text":"你没发现，未尝不是好事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_npc_237","isRemote":false,"text":"难道说......他们还在和别人谈合作？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_npc_237","isRemote":false,"text":"可我们并未收到任何维多利亚官方的订单......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"avg_npc_156_1","isRemote":true,"text":"......按照保密协定，我不该对跨部门的信息进行猜测或评论。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"avg_npc_156_1","isRemote":true,"text":"请把我的这些话忘掉吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"avg_npc_156_1","isRemote":true,"text":"专注你的任务，有什么情况，随时和我联络。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"avg_npc_156_1","isRemote":true,"text":"记住，这次虽然是黑钢接的任务，但我们和罗德岛的合作依然有效。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_npc_237","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，我明白。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_npc_237","isRemote":false,"text":"等罗德岛的几支小队也顺利靠近伦蒂尼姆，在必要的时候我会和他们互相接应。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_bridge"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"char_112_seige","isRemote":false,"text":"......越来越近了啊。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"维娜，你很紧张？","value":"1","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"char_112_seige","isRemote":false,"text":"几个月前，凯尔希医生问我是否准备好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"char_112_seige","isRemote":false,"text":"......我的回答是，我不知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"char_112_seige","isRemote":false,"text":"而到了这时候......我依旧不知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"char_112_seige","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，我很难说自己不紧张。"}]},{"label":"......","value":"2","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"char_112_seige","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，谢谢你在这里陪我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"char_112_seige","isRemote":false,"text":"如果我还在贪图你身边的这份清静......我是不是显得太逃避了？"}]},{"label":"这一天我们都等了很久。","value":"3","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"char_112_seige","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，从我逃出来的那一天起，我就在等着回去的这一天。"}]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"char_112_seige","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，我忍不住想，如果一个人离开他原本所属的环境太久，他真的还有家可回吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"醒来的时候，我都不记得自己离开了多久。","value":"1","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"char_112_seige","isRemote":false,"text":"我听你说起过那段日子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"char_112_seige","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，你刚醒没多久，就不得不站在指挥的位置上，经历了切尔诺伯格那么严重的事件......几乎没人能够做到像你一样。"}]},{"label":"阿米娅和大家都接纳了我。","value":"2","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"char_112_seige","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米娅......博士，你对阿米娅来说，是真正的家人。"}]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"char_112_seige","isRemote":false,"text":"罗德岛需要你，我们这些干员也都需要你，这一点毋庸置疑。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"在伦蒂尼姆，也有人等着你。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"char_112_seige","isRemote":false,"text":"格拉斯哥帮。他们一定有了新的头领，否则，他们无法在伦蒂尼姆立足。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"char_112_seige","isRemote":false,"text":"至于其他人......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"char_112_seige","isRemote":false,"text":"我相信我离开这么久，伦蒂尼姆压根就不会少掉一枚钉子。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"想知道答案的话，就只能一起往前了。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"char_112_seige","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，你说过......你也想去伦蒂尼姆寻找真相。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"char_112_seige","isRemote":false,"text":"一起往前吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"char_112_seige","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，确定有你们同行，我也能打起精神了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"char_112_seige","isRemote":false,"text":"我希望，前方等待着我们的答案都不至于太糟糕......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"char_112_seige","isRemote":false,"text":"至少，无论如何，我会努力用锤子把它锤出个过得去的模样。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_hall_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摄政王","speakerId":"avg_npc_062","isRemote":false,"text":"他们是否都到了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赦罪师","speakerId":"avg_npc_055","isRemote":false,"text":"快了，殿下，食腐者之王与血魔大君将在三日内抵达伦蒂尼姆。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摄政王","speakerId":"avg_npc_062","isRemote":false,"text":"自从王庭重新聚首，我们萨卡兹正处于内战后最接近统一的阶段。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摄政王","speakerId":"avg_npc_062","isRemote":false,"text":"不能让任何势力挡在我们面前。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赦罪师","speakerId":"avg_npc_055","isRemote":false,"text":"说起其他势力，殿下，那名来自小丘郡的使者至今仍在伦蒂尼姆。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摄政王","speakerId":"avg_npc_062","isRemote":false,"text":"这件事已有结论。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赦罪师","speakerId":"avg_npc_055","isRemote":false,"text":"正如殿下先前说的那样，他们并非真心想要结盟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赦罪师","speakerId":"avg_npc_055","isRemote":false,"text":"一个有诚意的盟友，不会把自己藏在幕后，连半张脸都不露，只把一个半疯半傻的仆人丢到我们面前。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赦罪师","speakerId":"avg_npc_055","isRemote":false,"text":"她不可能得到想要的，却并没有就此离去。她带来的部队，在伦蒂尼姆外围与贵族残党和当地居民发生了多次冲突。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摄政王","speakerId":"avg_npc_062","isRemote":false,"text":"试探。他们想刺探伦蒂尼姆的现状，同时评估我们的实力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赦罪师","speakerId":"avg_npc_055","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，殿下，如果我们表现得软弱，她背后的人将会提前入局。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赦罪师","speakerId":"avg_npc_055","isRemote":false,"text":"而如果我们态度强硬，她就是一枚失去价值的弃子，被剪除了也并不可惜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摄政王","speakerId":"avg_npc_062","isRemote":false,"text":"想让萨卡兹当刀子的阴谋家，最后都会死于刀下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摄政王","speakerId":"avg_npc_062","isRemote":false,"text":"她甚至不及塔露拉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赦罪师","speakerId":"avg_npc_055","isRemote":false,"text":"虽然有着相近的血脉，但深池的领袖与塔露拉截然不同。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赦罪师","speakerId":"avg_npc_055","isRemote":false,"text":"与整合运动相比，深池在南部掀起的波澜，足以证明他们有足够的武力，做好了或者正在做着撕扯维多利亚的准备。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摄政王","speakerId":"avg_npc_062","isRemote":false,"text":"一群趁乱获利的人，只有在混乱到达顶点时，才会现身。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摄政王","speakerId":"avg_npc_062","isRemote":false,"text":"现阶段，只要和我们眼前的目标和萨卡兹无关，无论他们在外面有何谋划，都不值得我关心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摄政王","speakerId":"avg_npc_062","isRemote":false,"text":"但是在伦蒂尼姆，我不允许节外生枝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摄政王","speakerId":"avg_npc_062","isRemote":false,"text":"让曼弗雷德顺带把这事处理了。应付那些贵族对他来说太简单，他需要尽快成长。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赦罪师","speakerId":"avg_npc_055","isRemote":false,"text":"曼弗雷德向来知道你的想法，他已经做好了准备。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摄政王","speakerId":"avg_npc_062","isRemote":false,"text":"还不够。罗德岛有什么新动向？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赦罪师","speakerId":"avg_npc_055","isRemote":false,"text":"这几个月，他们没有停止过正常的、表面上的“商业活动”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赦罪师","speakerId":"avg_npc_055","isRemote":false,"text":"那艘陆上舰船在去年年底驶离卡西米尔以后，曾多次靠近维多利亚，但并没有长时间脱离过我们的视线。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摄政王","speakerId":"avg_npc_062","isRemote":false,"text":"只要他们靠近伦蒂尼姆......不，只要那几个人进入维多利亚， 立刻向我汇报。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摄政王","speakerId":"avg_npc_062","isRemote":false,"text":"或者，你可以直接向她报告。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赦罪师","speakerId":"avg_npc_055","isRemote":false,"text":"当然，殿下——萨卡兹的王，自然知道该如何去回收属于她的冠冕。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_ep09"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_003_kalts","aliases":["凯尔希"]},{"speakerId":"char_010_chen","aliases":["陈"]},{"speakerId":"char_112_seige","aliases":["推进之王"]}]}
